# Needs {{screenId}} with an active layout (layouts.http) and {{movieId}} (movies.http).

### Schedule a show
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"movieId": {{movieId}}, "screenId": {{screenId}}, "startTime": "2026-10-03T18:15:00+05:30",
 "language": "HI", "format": "2D", "priceOverrides": {"PREMIUM": 32000}}

> {% client.global.set("showId", response.body.id); client.global.set("theaterId", response.body.theaterId); %}

### Overlapping show on the same screen -> 409 SHOW_OVERLAP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"movieId": {{movieId}}, "screenId": {{screenId}}, "startTime": "2026-10-03T20:00:00+05:30",
 "language": "HI", "format": "2D"}

### Open it for sale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows/{{showId}}/open
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### A theater's shows for a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows?theaterId={{theaterId}}&date=2026-10-03
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### Change prices for this show only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows/{{showId}}/prices
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"prices": {"REGULAR": 28000}}

### Block seats for this show (seat ids come from GET /screens/{id}/layouts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows/{{showId}}/seats/block
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"seatIds": [1, 2]}

### Unblock them
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows/{{showId}}/seats/unblock
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"seatIds": [1, 2]}

### Cancel it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shows/{{showId}}/cancel
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
